  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I got reports from friends the debug menu has some risk. Probably with special modified avatar, it seems they can get avatar ID information and so they can steal the avatars.\nThe worst is even the chance to steal accounts.\nSo it's very important to verify the reports and try fix it fast as possible.\n\nBecause some players decided to leave VRChat due too many security issues there. Security must stay as #1 in the list, not the nice features. Because in past times, we are already tired about every security problems and stealing avatars happens already for some players. You should respect others who spend many money in some avatars (also commissions with special prepared avatars / self build avatars) and this is exactly why VRChat developers must never overlook it. Some spend also a lot money in world creation. We must never forget it.\nOtherwise it will lead to the death of VRChat if it's too open and easy.",
